title: "AETRE & The Governed Agent: Unified Decision-Theoretic Operating System"
abstract: "A high-performance operations-research and Bayesian decision-theoretic engine uniting macroeconomic proposal/portfolio triage (AETRE: Kingman capacity, Pareto VOI, quadratic staking) and microeconomic execution governance (Governed Agent: Road A fail-closed verification gate, Bayesian Bellman stopping lattices, Tripartite Review Boundary, and c-mu rule Knapsack admission)."
